            "HOME HIGHLIGHTS:<br>- 3 KING bedrooms with TVs, all with private baths<br>- Bunk room and additional living space upstairs with TV for the kids<br>- Access to community pool<br>- Beautifully decorated throughout with new furnishings<br>- 2 Bikes<br>- Backyard entertaining area with grill<br>- Fully stocked kitchen<br>- Walking distance to Red Fish Village and several Blue Mountain restaurant favorites!<br>- Sandpiper Linen Program Participant: All linen, bedding and bath, are the highest quality. <br><br>OPTIONAL ADD-ONS<br>**Optional Cancellation Protection**- Allows cancellation for ANY reason up to 48 hours in advance of stay and guarantees 50% of all monies paid returned ($150 fee applies at booking).<br><br>Drift Away is located in the heart of Blue Mountain in a newer community. 5 minute walk to the beach, Drift Away has 4BR and sleeps 10 comfortably. <br><br>Floor 1:<br>Gorgeous Kitchen open to Great room and Dining area with Huge TV<br>King Suite with Private full bath<br>1/2 Bath<br>Outdoor access to front porch with Adirondack chairs and back yard <br><br>Floor 2:<br>King Suite, TV, Private on suite bath<br>King Suite, TV, Private on suite bath<br>Bunk room with 4 twins, private bath<br>Second living room with large TV- perfect hanout for the kids!<br>King master suite with large bathroom, separate tub and shower, TV and direct access to private balcony",
